{"id":"CVE-2013-0249","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2013-03-08T22:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T14:18:09.560Z","description":"Stack-based buffer overflow in the Curl_sasl_create_digest_md5_message function in lib/curl_sasl.c in curl and libcurl 7.26.0 through 7.28.1, when negotiating SASL DIGEST-MD5 authentication, allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (crash) and possibly execute arbitrary code via a long string in the realm parameter in a (1) POP3, (2) SMTP or (3) IMAP message.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujul2015-2367936.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/120170/Slackware-Security-Advisory-curl-Updates.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/57842","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"57842"},{"url":"http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2013/Oct/msg00004.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_APPLE"],"name":"APPLE-SA-2013-10-22-3"},{"url":"http://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/24487","tags":["exploit","x_refsource_EXPLOIT-DB"],"name":"24487"},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1721-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-1721-1"},{"url":"http://lists.fedoraproject.org/pipermail/package-announce/2013-February/099140.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_FEDORA"],"name":"FEDORA-2013-2098"},{"url":"http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1028093","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_SECTRACK"],"name":"1028093"},{"url":"http://www.osvdb.org/89988","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_OSVDB"],"name":"89988"},{"url":"http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/120147/cURL-Buffer-Overflow.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://blog.volema.com/curl-rce.html","tags":["x_refsource_MISC"]},{"url":"http://curl.haxx.se/docs/adv_20130206.html","tags":["x_refso