{"id":"CVE-2013-2174","state":"PUBLISHED","assigner":"redhat","published":"2013-07-31T10:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-08-06T15:27:41.030Z","description":"Heap-based buffer overflow in the curl_easy_unescape function in lib/escape.c in cURL and libcurl 7.7 through 7.30.0 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (application crash) or possibly execute arbitrary code via a crafted string ending in a \"%\" (percent) character.","cwe":["n/a"],"metrics":[],"affected":[{"vendor":"n/a","product":"n/a","versions":["affected n/a"]}],"references":[{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/ovmbulletinjul2016-3090546.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/topics/security/cpujul2015-2367936.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-updates/2013-07/msg00013.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_SUSE"],"name":"openSUSE-SU-2013:1133"},{"url":"http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0983.html","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_REDHAT"],"name":"RHSA-2013:0983"},{"url":"https://github.com/bagder/curl/commit/192c4f788d48f82c03e9cef40013f34370e90737","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]},{"url":"http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/60737","tags":["vdb-entry","x_refsource_BID"],"name":"60737"},{"url":"http://www.ubuntu.com/usn/USN-1894-1","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_UBUNTU"],"name":"USN-1894-1"},{"url":"http://www.debian.org/security/2013/dsa-2713","tags":["vendor-advisory","x_refsource_DEBIAN"],"name":"DSA-2713"},{"url":"http://curl.haxx.se/docs/adv_20130622.html","tags":["x_refsource_CONFIRM"]}],"vendors":["curl"]}
